    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Harley Jo",
            "Understood. I'll let her know.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 20,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Hans",
            "Protect Simon on your way out. 【kuroname】 is dying, so Simon is the only one who can protect the Constructs from being infected. It all depends on him whether all the Constructs can get out of this place in one piece.",
